---
---
<section class="services" id="layanan">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">// Kapabilitas Kami</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">Apa yang Kami Bangun</h2>
      <p class="section-desc">Tiga pilar keahlian yang saling melengkapi untuk menghadirkan solusi teknologi dari hardware hingga cloud.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="bento-grid">
      
      <!-- Bento 1: Web -->
      <div class="bento-card reveal">
        <div>
          <div class="bento-icon-wrap">
            <svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#icon-code"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Web Platforms &amp; APIs</h3>
          <p>Arsitektur web modern yang responsif, terstruktur, aman, dan siap menangani pertumbuhan traffic tinggi tanpa kendala performa.</p>
        </div>
        <ul class="bento-deliverables">
          <li><svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#icon-check"/></svg>Custom Web Applications &amp; Portals</li>
          <li><svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#icon-check"/></svg>RESTful API &amp; Microservices</li>
          <li><svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#icon-check"/></svg>Executive Dashboard &amp; Analytics</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Bento 2: Mobile -->
      <div class="bento-card reveal">
        <div>
          <div class="bento-icon-wrap">
            <svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#icon-smartphone"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Mobile Engineering</h3>
          <p>Pengalaman mobile mulus berbasis Android native dan Flutter dengan integrasi database real-time dan standar UI/UX konsisten.</p>
        </div>
        <ul class="bento-deliverables">
          <li><svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#icon-check"/></svg>Cross-Platform Apps (Flutter)</li>
          <li><svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#icon-check"/></svg>Realtime Cloud Synchronization</li>
          <li><svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#icon-check"/></svg>Hardware &amp; Bluetooth Connectivity</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Bento 3: IoT -->
      <div class="bento-card reveal">
        <div>
          <div class="bento-icon-wrap">
            <svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#icon-cpu"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>IoT &amp; Embedded Systems</h3>
          <p>Menghubungkan dunia fisik dan digital melalui mikrokontroler, protokol IoT hemat daya, otomasi perangkat, dan pemantauan sensor cerdas.</p>
        </div>
        <ul class="bento-deliverables">
          <li><svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#icon-check"/></svg>ESP32 / Arduino / Sensor Modules</li>
          <li><svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#icon-check"/></svg>MQTT Protocol &amp; Edge Processing</li>
          <li><svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#icon-check"/></svg>Smart Automation &amp; RFID Systems</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

